sequenceDiagram
    participant E as Edge Management System
    participant K as Kafka-Compatible Data Distribution Service
    participant U as Utility Data-Lake Adapter
    participant V as Application Vendor Adapter

    Note over E,V: Normal continuous consumption
    E->>K: Publish GEISA data record 1 (Kafka Produce)
    K-->>U: Return record 1 when available
    K-->>V: Return record 1 when available
    U->>K: Commit Utility consumer position
    V->>K: Commit Application Vendor consumer position

    Note over U,U: Utility consumer becomes unavailable
    E->>K: Publish GEISA data records 2 and 3
    K-->>V: Return records 2 and 3 when available
    V->>K: Commit Application Vendor consumer position
    Note over K,U: Records remain available according to configured retention

    Note over U,K: Utility consumer reconnects
    U->>K: Resume continuous consumption from committed position
    K-->>U: Return retained records 2 and 3
    U->>K: Commit Utility consumer position

    Note over U,V: One consumer's outage does not interrupt another consumer
